Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:11.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,320)}Every project starts with an agreement. But when work, milestones, and money come together, trust alone isn't always enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:31.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,320)}Meet FairHold. A milestone based platform designed to bring structure, evidence, and accountability to payments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.40,0:00:50.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,320)}FairHold brings buyers and sellers into a structured deal workflow, where expectations and milestones are clearly defined.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:10.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,320)}Instead of treating an entire project as one uncertain transaction, FairHold organizes the work into individual milestones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.60,0:01:28.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,320)}Work can be supported with evidence, giving reviewers something concrete to evaluate before a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.60,0:01:48.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,320)}Submitted evidence enters a review process. The decision remains with the authorized human reviewer. AI can assist, but it does not replace human judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.60,0:02:12.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,320)}The guided demo illustrates the capture stage using a simulated payment flow, without moving real money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.60,0:02:28.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,320)}That's the principle behind FairHold. AI provides assistance. Humans make the decisions. Deterministic rules govern payment operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.40,0:02:48.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,320)}FairHold. Bringing structure and accountability to milestone based payments.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.20,0:00:47.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,790)\fad(450,450)}One structured agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:55.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,790)\fad(450,450)}Clearly defined milestones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.60,0:01:07.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,790)\fad(450,450)}Break work into milestones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:14.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,790)\fad(450,450)}Make progress visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.60,0:01:28.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,790)\fad(450,450)}Evidence before approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.60,0:01:42.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,790)\fad(450,450)}Evidence gets reviewed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.20,0:01:50.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,790)\fad(450,450)}Humans retain control.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:58.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,790)\fad(450,450)}Approval matters.

